 r←Test_Input_Misc_020(stopFlag batchFlag);n;⎕TRAP;DT;defMat;parms
⍝ Exercise "Input" with testMode←1 and autoPress←1 and timeout←2
 r←∆Failed
 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '. ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')

 DT←#.APLGUI.APLGUI.Enums.InputDataTypes

 defMat←0 7⍴''
 defMat⍪←'Character1' '' 'Kai Jaeger'DT.Character 0 1 1
 defMat⍪←'Numeric1' '' 123 DT.Numeric 0 1 1

 parms←#.APLGUI.APLGUI.Input.CreateParms
 parms.posn←55 55
 parms.testMode←1
 parms.autoPress←1
 n←#.APLGUI.APLGUI.Input.Create defMat ⍬ parms
 1 ∆Process n.∆Form
 →GoToTidyUp~0∊⍴n.∆result

 r←∆OK

∆TidyUp:
 n.∆CloseForm
